# .graphifyignore — scope the api knowledge graph to OUR code.
#
# Same syntax as .gitignore. graphify already auto-respects .gitignore; this
# only ADDS exclusions. external/ is vendored CoreGo deps (git submodules —
# therefore NOT in .gitignore); excluding it keeps the graph to api's own
# code rather than ~1100 vendored files.
external/
